    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI sales lead qualification assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following lead and determine how valuable it may be for the sales team.\n\nLead details:\n- Name: {{ $json.body.name }}\n- Email: {{ $json.body.email }}\n- Company: {{ $json.body.company }}\n- Company size: {{ $json.body.company_size }}\n- Monthly budget: {{ $json.body.budget }}\n- Business need: {{ $json.body.business_need }}\n- Lead source: {{ $json.body.lead_source }}\n\nEvaluate the lead based on company size, budget, and how clearly the business need matches an automation solution.\n\nReturn your answer in valid JSON only, with these exact fields:\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 85,\n  \"qualification\": \"High\",\n  \"reason\": \"The company has a clear automation need and a substantial stated budget.\",\n  \"talking_points\": [\n    \"Ask about their current lead capture process.\",\n    \"Discuss automating lead qualification and follow-ups.\"\n  ]\n}\n\nRules:\n- lead_score must be a number from 1 to 100.\n- qualification must be High, Medium, or Low.\n- High: clear business need and substantial budget.\n- Medium: some potential, but budget or requirements need clarification.\n- Low: unclear need or very limited budget.\n- Give reasons and talking points specific to the supplied lead.\n- Do not invent information that is not provided.\n- Return JSON only, without Markdown fences.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -416,
